# data/sources/sleeper_stats/<season>/week_<week>.json -- trimmed Sleeper weekly
# usage lines. Written by fantasy-football-4-fun/sleepermetrics/nflstats.py
# on every successful live fetch; read back as the offline / cold-host
# fallback (same durable-JSON idea as data/sources/adp/). Named for the
# source (Sleeper's own weekly feed), distinct from nflverse's own
# differently-shaped player_stats dataset under data/sources/nflverse/. One
# file per (season, week). This .gitkeep keeps the directory present before
# the first snapshot is committed.
